ns to increase or decrease the power of your cannon, an arsenal of explosives and Utility actions like Wait and Loop. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660060/extras/a820ad33289a3eba16800698b3e6a59e.poster.avif?t=1760694685\" width=600 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660060/extras/a820ad33289a3eba16800698b3e6a59e.webm?t=1760694685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660060/extras/a820ad33289a3eba16800698b3e6a59e.mp4?t=1760694685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chain Reactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dealing with your enemies in the fewest amount of moves is paramount to success, but there's only so much room in a sequence. This is where the abilities of your enemies comes in to play. All the baddies have some sort of feature or quirk, you can use to take out multiple foes at once. Figure out which enemies to shoot and in what order, but be careful as each round some of the enemies move changing the field of battle!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660060/extras/4028e19760f24a33fd2bd7bfbf23c124.poster.avif?t=1760694685\" width=600 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660060/extras/4028e19760f24a33fd2bd7bfbf23c124.webm?t=1760694685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660060/extras/4028e19760f24a33fd2bd7bfbf23c124.mp4?t=1760694685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Eye to Behold</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gnome <i>Cal</i> and his wife, the troll <i>Bomba</i> are on a journey to take out the wicked <i>Beholder</i>. Their quest will take them across 3 worlds each with 24 levels and a boss fight. If you like a challenge you can try the Hard mode with a set of unique levels and harder Boss-fights, doubling the amount of puzzles. There's a quick prologue world as well to help players ease into the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>","developers":["Filiokus"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660060/8b123a76253080a0c1bc792cb3e4967e63977e0f/header.jpg?t=1760694685","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3660060/271372319/a11eb5ab683fe54d328a9d31b2d98efe1399b104/1759240168/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759257941","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3660060/271372319/a11eb5ab683fe54d328a9d31b2d98efe1399b104/1759240168/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759257941","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3660060/271372319/a11eb5ab683fe54d328a9d31b2d98efe1399b104/1759240168/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759257941","id":257209313,"name":"Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257209313/8c9898cdd1e79fc2dd4f8e01e7a36c5a5052bc3b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759257941"}],"name":"Cal & Bomba","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Cal & Bomba - $9.99 USD","packageid":1289569,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":999}],"title":"Buy Cal & Bomba"}],"packages":[1289569],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong